        "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ group: 252912404</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also has DISCORD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Old World is Gone. Can You Build a New One?​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Swarm consumed civilization. Now, survivors cling to life in ​<strong>​</strong>rusted strongholds<strong>​</strong>​. But you—​<strong>​</strong>guided by a forgotten starship<strong>​</strong>​—dive into the ruins, leading a squad to ​<strong>​scavenge, fight, and uncover the truth.​</strong>​</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Scavenge or Die​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fog hides monsters... and miracles. ​​Lost technology​​ waits in the wreckage—use it to tip the scales.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Adapt or Be Overrun​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies strike without warning. ​<strong>​No static defenses—</strong>push forward, fall back, outmaneuver.<strong>​</strong>​ Every map is a new nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Jury-Rigged Warfare​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets are ​<strong>​ammo, not assets​</strong>​. Drag them, break them, modify them. ​​Your only rule: survive.​​</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>War Machine​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just a soldier—you’re ​<strong>​an engineer, a strategist, a leader​</strong>​. Research, craft, and ​<strong>​turn scraps into salvation.​</strong>​</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Old World is Gone. Can You Build a New One?​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Swarm consumed civilization. Now, survivors cling to life in ​<strong>​</strong>rusted strongholds<strong>​</strong>​. But you—​<strong>​</strong>guided by a forgotten starship<strong>​</strong>​—dive into the ruins, leading a squad to ​<strong>​scavenge, fight, and uncover the truth.​</strong>​</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Scavenge or Die​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fog hides monsters... and miracles. ​​Lost technology​​ waits in the wreckage—use it to tip the scales.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Adapt or Be Overrun​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies strike without warning. ​<strong>​No static defenses—</strong>push forward, fall back, outmaneuver.<strong>​</strong>​ Every map is a new nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>​Jury-Rigged Warfare​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets are ​<strong>​ammo, not assets​</strong>​. Drag them, break them, modify them. ​​Your only rule: survive.​​</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >​<strong>War Machine​</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just a soldier—you’re ​<strong>​an engineer, a strategist, a leader​</strong>​. Research, craft, and ​<strong>​turn scraps into salvation.​</strong>​</p>",
